# Drives reels/web/fixture.html in a browser reel starts (mise run live-web records it and checks the take): a Play
# button that starts a quiet 440 Hz tone, a text field, a list, a link and room to scroll to #end. The page writes
# what happened to its log, and the reel waits for each entry, so a step that did not work stops the take.
Open web/fixture.html

Output ../build/web.mp4
Output ../build/web.gif
Set Viewport 1000x700
Set ZoomEasing smooth

Wait "reel web fixture"
Caption "A web page, driven by a reel"
Click "Play"
Wait "played"
Sleep 1s
Caption "Type, select all, type again"
Click "Name"
Type "hello reel"
Key cmd+a
Type "Musicbox"
Key return
Wait "submitted Musicbox"
Caption off
Zoom #list 2x
Scroll down 8 #list
Wait "scrolled"
Sleep 500ms
Zoom off
Caption "The same page, at another fragment, then again"
Open web/fixture.html#end
Wait "at end"
Open web/fixture.html#end
Wait "reloaded"
Open web/fixture.html#top
Wait "at top"
Caption off
Click "Next page"
Wait "Second page"
Sleep 1s
